@startuml
title Alarm Clock State Diagram

[*] --> Off
state "Off" as Off
state "Activated" as Activated
state "Ringing" as Ringing
state "Active" as Active

Off --> [*]
Off --> Activated : set alarm time

Activated --> Off : turn off alarm
Activated --> Ringing : current time matches alarm time

Ringing --> Off : stop alarm
Ringing --> Activated : next scheduled alarm time

@enduml
